5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,We should start by checking which of these options relies on conditions we cannot control.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a wise starting point. I am also curious about how our current building locations affect who can actually reach us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate when we pretend we haven't tried things before! We should look at the old records to see what actually worked.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the funding structure is the real trap here, not the size of the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to verify if the required skills for any new program actually exist on our current staff roster before we commit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, you are right to be cautious. I would like to look into the county grant terms and the endowment to see how long the money actually lasts.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I agree. I will examine the bus links in the two outer wards to see who is currently cut off.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see if people actually showed up before!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the running and equipment lines last year to see where the money actually went.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will check the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the necessary skills in-house.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, your instinct is sound. I will also look into the two programmes begun six years ago to see what records remain.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Rin, I will also examine the winter road closures north of the river to understand the physical barriers we face.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see when people actually want to come in!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also review the county grant terms and the endowment to see how the funding is actually structured.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also review the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see who is actually qualified to run these sessions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all looking at the same facts. Let us see what the records tell us before we decide.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see when people actually want to come in.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m done picking! I hope the old records show we were right all along.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am content with my selections. The ledger and the grant terms should reveal the structural weaknesses we keep ignoring.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am satisfied with my choices. The register and the certification records will tell us exactly who is qualified to lead these new initiatives.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
