60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: The candidates are here. I am worried that the mobile branch depends on roads and vehicles we cannot control.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Shizue, the mobile branch directly addresses the bus gap, but I worry about the winter closures you mentioned.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Shizue, but the mobile branch goes to the outer wards where forty people showed up! That is exactly what we need!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the attendance is promising, but the vehicle line already overran by a third. I cannot support a proposal that guarantees a recurring budget breach.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the vehicle cost is a concern, but the mobile branch doesn't require new supervision skills. We already have the staff to run it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Minako, I am not convinced. The vehicle depends on roads and weather, which are conditions we cannot control.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, that is a fair point on staffing, but the winter closures prove the vehicle cannot reach everyone reliably.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, but the halls kept their timetables when the roads were shut! So people still want to come, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the halls are stationary. A van is not. If the roads close, the van stops, and the service fails.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, the closures were brief. The bus loss is permanent. We must prioritize reaching those cut off, despite the weather risks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Minako, the bus loss is permanent, yes, but a vehicle is fragile. I fear we are trading one dependency for another.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I understand the fragility, but the alternative is leaving those wards isolated. The mobile branch is the only option that bridges that specific gap.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Jonathan, but the old outreach worked! If the van is too risky, can we just use the community halls like before?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the halls are not ours to command. We cannot simply rent space without a budget line, and the grant ends in twelve months.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the grant covers session fees, not vehicle maintenance. We must separate the funding streams to see if the mobile branch is truly unaffordable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Minako, you are right to separate the streams. I will vote for the mobile branch, hoping the flat budget can sustain it after the grant ends.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I share your hope, but the winter closures are a hard fact. I cannot ignore the risk of a stranded vehicle.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Jonathan, but the halls proved people show up! If the van is too risky, why not just use the community halls like before?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the halls are not ours to command. We cannot simply rent space without a budget line, and the grant ends in twelve months.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the grant covers session fees, not vehicle maintenance. We must separate the funding streams to see if the mobile branch is truly unaffordable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
